{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47286","headline":"游仙二十四首 二十三 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纵身太霞上，眇眇虚中浮。\n八威先啓行，五老同我游。\n灵景何灼灼，祥风正寥寥。\n啸歌振长空，逸响清且柔。\n遨嬉无迹赏，顾眄皆真俦。\n不疾而自速，万天俄已周。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}